## 9. nn.Module

A model subclasses nn.Module:

~~~python
class MLP(nn.Module):
    def __init__(self):
        super().__init__()
        self.fc1 = nn.Linear(10, 64)
        self.fc2 = nn.Linear(64, 3)

    def forward(self, x):
        x = torch.relu(self.fc1(x))
        return self.fc2(x)
~~~

Calling model(x) invokes Module machinery around forward.

