## 9. Model Subclassing

~~~python
class MyModel(keras.Model):
    def __init__(self):
        super().__init__()
        self.fc1 = keras.layers.Dense(64)
        self.fc2 = keras.layers.Dense(3)

    def call(self, x, training=False):
        x = tf.nn.relu(self.fc1(x))
        return self.fc2(x)
~~~

Closest conceptual match to PyTorch nn.Module.

